   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1791824225432,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No ack (tunnel, coverage gap)? The anchor keeps its copy of the result and publishes it again on the next car/42/attach, until the deadline rules give up (C12).\nThe car never needs to know where its anchor is, and no zone needs another zone's address: MQTT topics route everything. The anchor is never in the result's data path.",
   "originalText": "No ack (tunnel, coverage gap)? The anchor keeps its copy of the result and publishes it again on the next car/42/attach, until the deadline rules give up (C12).\nThe car never needs to know where its anchor is, and no zone needs another zone's address: MQTT topics route everything. The anchor is never in the result's data path.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
